<title>ROMANIA: Romania October unemployment flat at 5.9 percent.</title>
<headline>Romania October unemployment flat at 5.9 percent.</headline>
<dateline>BUCHAREST 1996-11-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Romania's jobless rate was 5.9 percent last month, unchanged from September, the Labour Ministry said on Thursday.</p>
<p>It said the number of unemployment benefit claimants fell a slight 5,000 to 659,446 in October.</p>
<p>				 OCTOBER    SEPTEMBER   OCTOBER 1995</p>
<p> Number unemployed	 659,446     664,634   1.007 million</p>
<p> Pct of workforce	    5.9	    5.9	9.0</p>
<p>NOTE -- Romania's workforce is 11.235 million. The jobless rate is seen sliding to 8.3 percent this year from 8.9 percent in 1995, with the private sector absorbing some unemployment.</p>
<p>-- Bucharest Newsroom 40-1 3120264</p>
</text>
